# Line endings: text is LF in the repository and in the working tree on every
# platform. The extension and the browser scripts must be plain ASCII with LF
# endings (CLAUDE.md, Conventions; the suites check it), and without this file
# a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true turns them into CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.ico binary
